WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Email or print all the draft invoices at once.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.900
Drafts. The invoices not sent yet, for example after the month-end run.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:20.500
Email all. Emails each customer their own invoice, one after another. Any customer without an email address is listed so you can print theirs.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.067
Print all. One print job with every draft, a page each; they're marked sent.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:32.167
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
